OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783837217
OL,3,CBrad Friedel calls decision to suspend
OL,4,CBalogun match ban 'wrong'
OL,6,FBrad Friedel, who was elected into the
OL,7,FNational Soccer Hall of Fame in 2018,
OL,8,Fspoke to ITV News about the decision
OL,10,FFormer US goalkeeper Brad Friedel
OL,11,Fcalled the decision to suspend striker
OL,12,FFolarin Balogun's match ban "wrong",
OL,13,Fadding that it "opens up a can of
OL,14,Fworms" for other government
OL,15,Finterventions.
OL,17,F"I don't agree with any government
OL,18,Fanywhere in the world getting involved
OL,19,Fin sports," he said in an ITV News
OL,20,Finterview.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
