FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783837217
OL,3,CBrad Friedel calls decision to suspend
OL,4,CBalogun match ban 'wrong'
OL,6,F"I think politics and sports need to
OL,7,Fstay away from one another."
OL,9,FFriedel's comments come after Balogun
OL,10,Fhad his red card match ban overturned,
OL,11,Ffollowing an intervention from US
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump, who called
OL,13,FFifa President Gianni Infantino to ask
OL,14,Ffor a review into the card issued
OL,15,Fagainst the US star striker.
OL,17,FAmid public criticisms that Fifa had
OL,18,F"crossed a red line", questions were
OL,19,Fraised about whether the decision came
OL,20,Fas a consequence of the Trump
OL,21,FInfantino call.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783837217
OL,3,CBrad Friedel calls decision to suspend
OL,4,CBalogun match ban 'wrong'
OL,6,FTrump said Fifa made the final
OL,7,Fdecision to lift Balogun's mandatory
OL,8,Fone-game ban, which the punishment for
OL,9,Fa foul tackle during their 2-0 winning
OL,10,FWorld Cup match against Bosnia-
OL,11,FHerzegovina on Thursday.
OL,13,F"All I did was ask for a review,"
OL,14,FTrump said when asked about it during
OL,15,Fan unrelated Oval Office event on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,F"I didn't say, 'You have to do this'",
OL,19,Fhe added.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783837217
OL,3,CBrad Friedel calls decision to suspend
OL,4,CBalogun match ban 'wrong'
OL,6,FIn an interview with ITV News, Premier
OL,7,FLeague veteran Friedel admitted that
OL,8,Fthe red card was "soft", but said that
OL,9,Fa overturned decision should not have
OL,10,Ftaken place post VAR.
OL,12,F"It was wrong. Whether you agreed with
OL,13,Fthe red card or not, red cards are
OL,14,Fsubjective", the ex-keeper told ITV
OL,15,FNews.
OL,17,F"It just opens a can of worms" for
OL,18,F"every government to write a letter to
OL,19,FFifa to try to get a red card
OL,20,Fsuspended".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783837217
OL,3,CBrad Friedel calls decision to suspend
OL,4,CBalogun match ban 'wrong'
OL,6,FHe added that the "main blame" in his
OL,7,Feyes lies with Fifa.
OL,9,FThe reversed decision allowed Balogun
OL,10,Fto play in Monday's round of 16 match
OL,11,Fwith Belgium in Seattle, which the US
OL,12,Flost 1-4 .
OL,14,FFriedel told ITV News that it was "a
OL,15,Fshame" that the controversy "took
OL,16,Ffront and centre 24 hours prior to the
OL,17,Fgame, rather than just talking about
OL,18,Fwhat an intriguing match line up it
OL,19,Fcould be for the US v Belgium."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,318,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783837217
OL,3,CBrad Friedel calls decision to suspend
OL,4,CBalogun match ban 'wrong'
OL,6,F"I hope it never happens again. I'll
OL,7,Fjust leave it at that," he said.
OL,9,F"I'm not for it and I hope it never
OL,10,Fhappens again in any sport, not just
OL,11,Ffootball, in the World cup, in any
OL,12,Fsport."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/6
